*HEADING
MISES PLASTICITY WITH COMBINED ISOTROPIC-KINEMATIC HARDENING
WITH MULTIPLE BACKSTRESSES,
SIMPLE SHEAR (DISPLACEMENT CONTROL) TEST; CPS4
*part, name=part-1
*NODE,NSET=ALLN
1,0.,0.
2,1.,0.
3,1.,1.
4,0.,1.
*ELEMENT,TYPE=CPS4R,ELSET=ALLE
1,1,2,3,4
*SOLID SECTION,ELSET=ALLE,MATERIAL=ALLE
*end part
*assembly, name=assembly-1
*instance, name=part-1-1, part=part-1
*end instance
*end assembly
*MATERIAL,NAME=ALLE
*ELASTIC
200.E3,.3
*density
 7.82000e-09,
*PLASTIC, HARDENING=COMBINED, DATA TYPE=PARAMETERS, NUMBERBACKSTRESS=3
200., 2.222E4, 34.65
*CYCLIC HARDENING, PARAMETERS
200., 0., 0.
*BOUNDARY
assembly-1.part-1-1.1,1,2
assembly-1.part-1-1.2,1,2
assembly-1.part-1-1.3,2,2
assembly-1.part-1-1.4,2,2
*amplitude,name=smoothing_curve,definition=smooth step
 0., 0., 10e-3, 1.
**STEP 1***
*step,nlgeom=no
*dynamic,explicit
 ,10e-3
*BOUNDARY,amplitude=smoothing_curve
assembly-1.part-1-1.3,1,1,0.08
assembly-1.part-1-1.4,1,1,0.08
*output, field
*element output, elset=assembly-1.part-1-1.alle
 S, LE, PE, PEEQ, ALPHA
*node output, nset=assembly-1.part-1-1.alln
 U, RF
*output, history, variable=preselect
*element output, elset=assembly-1.part-1-1.alle
 S, PE, LE, PEEQ, ALPHA, ALPHAP
*file output, number interval = 10
*el file, elset=assembly-1.part-1-1.alle
 PEEQ, ALPHA, ALPHAP
*END STEP
